---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/site';

/** The legal notice in English (`/en/aviso-legal`); the Spanish one is the binding text. */
const { legal } = site;
const domain = new URL(site.url).host;
---

<Legal title="Legal notice">
  <p>
    In compliance with article 10 of Spanish Law 34/2002 on information society services and
    electronic commerce (LSSI-CE), these are the details of the owner of {domain}:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Owner: {legal.owner}</li>
    <li>Tax ID (NIF): {legal.taxId}</li>
    <li>Address: {legal.address}</li>
    <li>
      Email: <a href={`mailto:${legal.email}`}>{legal.email}</a>
    </li>
    {legal.registry ? <li>{legal.registry}</li> : null}
  </ul>

  <h2>Use of the website</h2>
  <p>
    Visitors agree to use this website lawfully and not to harm how it works or the devices of other
    people. Its information is a guide: prices and opening hours may change, and what we confirm by
    phone or in writing is what counts.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The texts, photos, logos and design of this website belong to {legal.owner} or are used with
    their authors' permission. They may not be copied or reused without authorisation, except for
    personal use.
  </p>

  <h2>Links</h2>
  <p>
    This website links to third-party services (maps, social networks, WhatsApp). We are not
    responsible for their content or for how they handle your data: please read their own terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Applicable law</h2>
  <p>
    This notice is governed by Spanish law. Any dispute will be settled by the courts that the law
    determines. This translation is provided for convenience; the Spanish version prevails.
  </p>
</Legal>
